  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Institutes and agencies set their own rules and selection. Your income meanwhile depends on your side service and preparation discipline.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is reading the official eligibility page fully before anything else.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and GATE and other entry routes after BSc: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools explain concepts, make practice questions and review errors. Rote revision shrinks.
  </p>
  <p>
    Strong fundamentals, steady practice and verified information hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to practise and review; later, own your plan and your decisions.
  </p>

